# Smolweb inline-image headed receipt. A local TLS Gemini capsule serves a
# gemtext document, then a PNG from a second request. `settle` includes the
# host-owned subresource correlation map, so the capture cannot race the image.
settle 30
key escape
open gemini://127.0.0.1:19652/inline-image.gmi
settle 60
assert visible
act Toggle live content
settle 60
assert content-live
assert surface content
capture 01_inline_image
log smolweb inline-image receipt complete
